abstract: "Three open CSV datasets modeling finalized 2026 Dutch tax parameters and legislated 2027 expat ruling changes (30% to 27%), 2026 Box 3 fictitious vs. actual-return break-even rates, and 2026-2027 Nibud/NHG expat mortgage buying power."
